# Flo Compass Product Boundaries

## We build
- Session discovery with explainable recommendations
- AI event Q&A over sessions/speakers/topics/venues
- Local "My Plan" shortlist (shared_preferences)
- Interest-based personalization

## We do NOT build (Accelevents owns)
- Registration, ticketing, check-in, badge printing
- Official agenda CRUD, attendee management, organizer admin

## Flo 2026 context
- 3-day event at Nagarro Gurgaon Office (~90 spaces across Ground + floors 6–13, North/South wings)
- Attendees overwhelmed by ~640 parallel sessions
- App complements Accelevents; demo must state this explicitly

## MVP order (do not reorder without team agreement)
1. Mock data loads → 2. Onboarding → 3. Discover → 4. Detail → 5. My Plan → 6. Companion
